                                                "sense_id": "0c8c33fd-11bc-3263-a9b0-1f18f0bed9e5",
                                                "text": "Among those who will be making the Otter valley resound to the strains of the guzheng and erhu is Wu Wenguang, who plays a piece of music 1,800 years old on the guqin, an instrument known to have existed 3,000 years ago."
